====Noun====
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|countable}} Any of many species of [[marine]] [[invertebrate]]s in the class {{taxfmt|Anthozoa|class}}, most of which build hard [[calcium carbonate]] [[skeleton]]s and form [[colony|colonies]], or a colony belonging to one of those species.
# {{lb|en|uncountable}} A hard substance made of the [[skeleton]]s of these organisms.
# {{lb|en|countable}} A somewhat [[yellowish]] [[orange]]-[[pink]] [[color]]; the color of [[red coral]] ({{taxlink|Corallium rubrum|species}}) of the Mediterranean Sea, commonly used as an ornament or gem.
#: {{color panel|FF7F50}}
#* {{RQ:Haggard She|passage=The '''coral''' faded even from her lips, till they were as white as Leo's face, and quivered pitifully.}}
# The [[ovary|ovaries]] of a [[cook]]ed [[lobster]]; so called from their color.
# {{lb|en|historical}} A piece of coral, usually fitted with small [[bell]]s and other [[appurtenance]]s, used by children as a [[plaything]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1859| author=w:Wilkie Collins|url=http://www.gutenberg.org/files/583/583-h/583-h.htm| title=The Woman in White| passage=On the very chair which I used to occupy when I was at work Marian was sitting now, with the child industriously sucking his '''coral''' upon her lap.}}

